{"title":"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many of the integers between 1 and 1000, inclusive, can be expressed as the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of the squares</a> of two nonnegative integers?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that all odd numbers can be obtained by using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42cea586a9a54289ca6bfee1d25c1d7e70e8b7e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)^2-a^2=2a+1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"19\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a nonnegative integer. All multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be obtained by using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/4/b9415eaa364d113ba4e83050aa376d4dd7bf3c2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b+1)^2-(b-1)^2 = 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"185\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive integer. Numbers congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6eb9d06f515dbd3a02640eab967650521b65371d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\pmod 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> cannot be obtained because squares are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/3/1e3db0bcc5c336904a8140918dd24340e912cbf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0, 1 \\pmod 4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583d5b04daca11bb511e420613f4504797da01ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500+250 = \\boxed{750}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME\" title=\"1997 AIME\">1997 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutio